All the files in this directory, with the exception of those ending in
the extension `.kps' and this README file, are KnotPlot knot or link files.
The files ending in `.kps' are KnotPlot command scripts, they may be 
executed by entering one of the following at the KnotPlot> prompt:

<the-script.kps

     or

read the-script.kps

-------------------------------------------------------------------------

update-formats.kps --- script to change the file format used in the basic
                       directory, see this file for documentation



